o":"洛阳","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"a2e73703-db0e-11ef-9fd1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛州","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛州","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"a2e73704-db0e-11ef-a4c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豐陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"丰阳","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"a2e73705-db0e-11ef-a35b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮阴","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"a2e73706-db0e-11ef-9af9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盱眙","place_name_jianti_auto":"盱眙","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"a2e73707-db0e-11ef-9ea1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"a2e73708-db0e-11ef-a6ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨淮郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"临淮郡","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"a2e73709-db0e-11ef-887e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"a2e7370a-db0e-11ef-92af-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"a2e7370b-db0e-11ef-a54a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淮陰","place_name_jianti_auto":"淮阴","start_index":131,"tongjian_id":"a2e7370c-db0e-11ef-a4c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"广陵","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"a2e7370d-db0e-11ef-9220-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"俱，姓也。秦初以洛州刺史治陝城；晉志曰：滅燕之後，移洛州治豐陽。參考前鄧羌以洛州刺史鎭洛陽，則是時洛州刺史猶治洛陽。是後北海公重以豫州刺史及平原公暉以豫州牧鎭洛陽，洛州刺史始移治豐陽。「淮陽」，晉書·載記作「淮陰」，當從之。淮陰、盱眙，前漢並屬臨淮郡；後漢、晉以淮陰屬廣陵。","note_content_jianti_auto":"俱，姓也。秦初以洛州刺史治陕城；晋志曰：灭燕之后，移洛州治丰阳。参考前邓羌以洛州刺史镇洛阳，则是时洛州刺史犹治洛阳。是后北海公重以豫州刺史及平原公晖以豫州牧镇洛阳，洛州刺史始移治丰阳。「淮阳」，晋书·载记作「淮阴」，当从之。淮阴、盱眙，前汉并属临淮郡；后汉、晋以淮阴属广陵。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"a2e71ea7-db0e-11ef-a422-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":14,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"邵羌見一百一卷海西公太和二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a2568dfa-db0e-11ef-ab9b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"邵羌","people_name_jianti_auto":"邵羌","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a2e73711-db0e-11ef-ab48-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"海西公","people_name_jianti_auto":"海西公","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a2e73712-db0e-11ef-bbbc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"邵羌見一百一卷海西公太和二年。從，才用翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"邵羌见一百一卷海西公太和二年。从，才用翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"a2e73710-db0e-11ef-8afc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a2e50f7d-db0e-11ef-8b60-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dùn","source_anchor_text":"郡太守戴𨔵於彭城且","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":15,"text":"𨔵","tongjian_id":"3d3ced9e-7c6e-5338-a3f1-d57322546151"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a2e50f7d-db0e-11ef-8b60-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"qí","source_anchor_text":"城為征南棊劫之勢東","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":38,"text":"棊","tongjian_id":"a4588588-a352-58aa-b0c7-5887fd6e752c"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","resolved_place_entity_id":704,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a2e73717-db0e-11ef-b860-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、淮安府（卷二十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"盖淮阴去丹阳四百里而近，北对青、泗，则转输易通；南出江津...","context_before":"...陆交通，易以观衅，沃野有开殖之资，方舟有运漕之利。是也。","source_end_index":192,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2cfa0d86-a7e0-5d07-8b70-8c3c618d029a","source_start_index":128,"source_text":"太元三年，苻秦入寇襄阳，其兖州刺史彭超曰：愿更遣重将攻淮南诸城，为棋劫之势，东西并运，丹阳不足平也。坚从之，益发兵寇淮阴、盱眙。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/三、淮安府（卷二十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"4秦兗州刺史彭超請攻沛郡太守戴𨔵於彭城，且曰：「願更遣重將攻淮南諸城，爲征南棊劫之勢，東西並進，丹陽不足平也！」秦王堅從之，使都督東討諸軍事；後將軍俱難、右禁將軍毛盛、洛州刺史邵保帥步騎七萬寇淮陽、盱眙。超，越之弟；保，羌之從弟也。八月，彭超攻彭城。詔右將軍毛虎生帥衆五萬鎭姑孰以禦秦兵。","content_fanyi":"前秦兖州刺史彭超请求在彭城攻打沛郡太守戴𨔵，并说：“希望再派得力将领进攻淮河以南各城，与征南大将军苻丕形成如同棋劫般互相牵制的态势，东西两路同时推进，丹阳就不难平定了！”前秦王苻坚听从了他的建议，命他都督东讨诸军事；前秦后将军俱难、右禁将军毛盛、洛州刺史邵保率领步骑七万进犯淮阳、盱眙。彭超是彭越的弟弟；邵保是邵羌的堂弟。八月，彭超进攻彭城。东晋朝廷下诏，命右将军毛虎生率领五万兵众镇守姑孰，以抵御前秦军队。","content_jianti_auto":"4秦兖州刺史彭超请攻沛郡太守戴𨔵于彭城，且曰：「愿更遣重将攻淮南诸城，为征南棋劫之势，东西并进，丹阳不足平也！」秦王坚从之，使都督东讨诸军事；后将军俱难、右禁将军毛盛、洛州刺史邵保帅步骑七万寇淮阳、盱眙。超，越之弟；保，羌之从弟也。八月，彭超攻彭城。诏右将军毛虎生帅众五万镇姑孰以御秦兵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9144,"number":4,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百四 (晉紀二十六) / 烈宗孝武皇帝上之中 / 三年 / 第 7 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a2e50f7d-db0e-11ef-8b60-a0d3651f611f","year_int":378},"tongjian_id":"a2e50f7d-db0e-11ef-8b60-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"沛郡","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鐵","people_name_jianti_auto":"铁","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f6f-db0e-11ef-acf0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景仁","people_name_jianti_auto":"景仁","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f70-db0e-11ef-97ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鐵，景仁小字也。悖，蒲內翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"铁，景仁小字也。悖，蒲内翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f6e-db0e-11ef-84ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉湛","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘湛","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f72-db0e-11ef-9fb5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史言劉湛怙權，時輩諂事之。處，昌呂翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史言刘湛怙权，时辈谄事之。处，昌吕翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f71-db0e-11ef-a2e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_setup","source_end_index":9,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"爲後廢義康誅湛張本","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a82a21a2-db0e-11ef-bd3f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"義康","people_name_jianti_auto":"义康","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f74-db0e-11ef-9b36-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"湛","people_name_jianti_auto":"湛","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f75-db0e-11ef-8c04-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲後廢義康誅湛張本。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为后废义康诛湛张本。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f73-db0e-11ef-9a93-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":13,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"庾登之見一百二十卷元嘉三年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a6fec142-db0e-11ef-8a12-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"庾登之","people_name_jianti_auto":"庾登之","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f77-db0e-11ef-9ab7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"庾登之見一百二十卷元嘉三年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"庾登之见一百二十卷元嘉三年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f76-db0e-11ef-995d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","resolved_place_entity_id":704,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f82-db0e-11ef-ba58-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"義康僚屬及諸附麗湛者，潛相約勒，無敢歷殷氏之門。彭城王主簿沛郡劉敬文父成，未悟其機，詣景仁求郡。敬文遽往謝湛曰：「老父悖耄，遂就殷鐵干祿。由敬文闇淺，上負生成，闔門慙懼，無地自處。」唯後將軍司馬庾炳之遊二人之間，皆得其歡心，而密輸忠於朝廷。景仁臥家不朝謁，帝常使炳之銜命往來，湛不疑也。炳之，登之之弟也，","content_fanyi":"刘义康的僚属以及那些依附刘湛的人，暗地里相互约束，没有人敢登殷景仁的家门。彭城王府主簿、沛郡人刘敬文的父亲刘成，没有看透其中的机关，前去殷景仁那里求取郡守职位。刘敬文急忙赶去向刘湛谢罪说：“我父亲年老糊涂，竟跑到殷铁，也就是殷景仁那里求官。都怪我愚昧浅薄，对上辜负了大恩，全家惭愧恐惧，无地自容。”当时只有后将军司马庾炳之在殷、刘二人之间来往交游，得到了他们两人的欢心，却暗中向朝廷表达忠心。殷景仁在家养病，不能每天上朝谒见，文帝常常派庾炳之奉命往来沟通，刘湛也不怀疑。庾炳之，是庾登之的弟弟。","content_jianti_auto":"义康僚属及诸附丽湛者，潜相约勒，无敢历殷氏之门。彭城王主簿沛郡刘敬文父成，未悟其机，诣景仁求郡。敬文遽往谢湛曰：「老父悖耄，遂就殷铁干禄。由敬文暗浅，上负生成，阖门慙惧，无地自处。」唯后将军司马庾炳之游二人之间，皆得其欢心，而密输忠于朝廷。景仁卧家不朝谒，帝常使炳之衔命往来，湛不疑也。炳之，登之之弟也，","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":11322,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二十二 (宋紀四) / 太祖文皇帝上之下 / 十二年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f6d-db0e-11ef-bad6-a0d3651f611f","year_int":435},"tongjian_id":"a7fe5f6d-db0e-11ef-bad6-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"沛郡","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"少，詩沼翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"少，诗沼翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"a88db58f-db0e-11ef-b4ba-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"東海郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东海郡","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a88db592-db0e-11ef-bd51-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"贛榆縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"赣榆县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a88db593-db0e-11ef-b0c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東海","place_name_jianti_auto":"东海","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a88db594-db0e-11ef-b2a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鬱洲","place_name_jianti_auto":"郁洲","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a88db595-db0e-11ef-8163-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東海軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"东海军","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"a88db596-db0e-11ef-8221-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"青州","place_name_jianti_auto":"青州","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"a88db597-db0e-11ef-bd61-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"a88db598-db0e-11ef-bcd6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"a88db599-db0e-11ef-877d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"青","place_name_jianti_auto":"青","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"a88db59a-db0e-11ef-b9a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"冀","place_name_jianti_auto":"冀","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"a88db59b-db0e-11ef-9e75-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"東海郡贛榆縣東海中有鬱洲，今東海軍是其地。泰始三年，於此僑立青州，齊、梁爲青、冀二州刺史治所。卷，讀曰捲。鬱，音聿。","note_content_jianti_auto":"东海郡赣榆县东海中有郁洲，今东海军是其地。泰始三年，于此侨立青州，齐、梁为青、冀二州刺史治所。卷，读曰卷。郁，音聿。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"a88db591-db0e-11ef-b839-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"判，亦決也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"判，亦决也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"a88db59c-db0e-11ef-83c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"沈慶之","people_name_jianti_auto":"沈庆之","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a88db59e-db0e-11ef-a846-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"何勗","people_name_jianti_auto":"何勗","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a88db59f-db0e-11ef-9411-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"彭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"彭城","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a0-db0e-11ef-8af6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"歷城","place_name_jianti_auto":"历城","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a1-db0e-11ef-b897-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"沈慶之之議，自彭城趨歷城猶曰主於進；何勗之議則主於奔退耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"沈庆之之议，自彭城趋历城犹曰主于进；何勗之议则主于奔退耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"a88db59d-db0e-11ef-810f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張暢","people_name_jianti_auto":"张畅","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a3-db0e-11ef-bd8f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a4-db0e-11ef-b646-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蕭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"萧城","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a5-db0e-11ef-8a8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a6-db0e-11ef-9e55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"時沛郡治蕭城。張暢以安北長史帶沛郡太守。高，抗也；贊，助也；言抗聲以助決其議也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"时沛郡治萧城。张畅以安北长史带沛郡太守。高，抗也；赞，助也；言抗声以助决其议也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":161,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a2-db0e-11ef-b7c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"扃，古熒翻，外閉之關也。此言門守嚴固，百姓無從得去。","note_content_jianti_auto":"扃，古荧翻，外闭之关也。此言门守严固，百姓无从得去。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"a88db5a7-db0e-11ef-96ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"義恭","people_name_jianti_auto":"义恭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a88db5ab-db0e-11ef-9841-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"彭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"彭城","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a88db5ac-db0e-11ef-be2b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"義恭頓彭城爲諸軍節度，故曰總統。阿，讀從安入聲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"义恭顿彭城为诸军节度，故曰总统。阿，读从安入声。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":276,"tongjian_id":"a88db5aa-db0e-11ef-8c5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"義恭","people_name_jianti_auto":"义恭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a88db5ae-db0e-11ef-855e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"駿","people_name_jianti_auto":"骏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a88db5af-db0e-11ef-8775-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"駿","people_name_jianti_auto":"骏","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a88db5b0-db0e-11ef-b070-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"道民","people_name_jianti_auto":"道民","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a88db5b1-db0e-11ef-aba7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐州","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a88db5b2-db0e-11ef-8333-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"彭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"彭城","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a88db5b3-db0e-11ef-9f17-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"義恭於駿，諸父也。駿小字道民。徐州刺史治彭城，故曰城主。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"义恭于骏，诸父也。骏小字道民。徐州刺史治彭城，故曰城主。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":297,"tongjian_id":"a88db5ad-db0e-11ef-b131-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a88db58e-db0e-11ef-bfb7-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xù","source_anchor_text":"尉長史何勗欲席卷奔","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":99,"text":"勗","tongjian_id":"bc852c18-e87e-5c7e-836f-782b4880195c"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","resolved_place_entity_id":1936,"start_index":133,"tongjian_id":"a88e539a-db0e-11ef-bdbf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、淮安府（卷二十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"泰始三年，魏人围青州刺史明僧嵩于东阳，刘怀珍自山阳浮海赴...","context_before":"...浮海北走郁洲，将军高雅之御之，为恩所执，既而刘裕破走之。","source_end_index":139,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dd13a316-5a7f-5afd-ba82-6363a3ea7efa","source_start_index":93,"source_text":"宋元嘉二十七年，魏人南寇，进逼彭城，时江夏王义恭督兵彭城，甚惧，长史何勖议席卷奔郁洲，不果。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/三、淮安府（卷二十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"魏兵在蕭城，去彭城十餘里。彭城兵雖多而食少，太尉江夏王義恭欲棄彭城南歸。安北中兵參軍沈慶之以爲歷城兵少食多，欲爲函箱車陳，以精兵爲外翼，奉二王及妃女直趨歷城；分兵配護軍蕭思話，使留守彭城。太尉長史何勗欲席卷奔鬱洲，自海道還京師。義恭去意已判，惟二議彌日未決。安北長史沛郡太守張暢曰：「若歷城、鬱洲有可至之理，下官敢不高贊！今城中乏食，百姓咸有走志，但以關扃嚴固，欲去莫從耳。一旦動足，則各自逃散，欲至所在，何由可得！今軍食雖寡，朝夕猶未窘罄；豈有捨萬安之術而就危亡之道！若此計必行，下官請以頸血汚公馬蹄。武陵王駿謂義恭曰：「阿父旣爲總統，去留非所敢干，道民忝爲城主，而委鎭奔逃，實無顏復奉朝廷，必與此城共其存沒，張長史言不可異也。」義恭乃止。","content_fanyi":"魏军在萧城，距彭城十多里。彭城守军虽多但粮食短缺，太尉江夏王刘义恭打算放弃彭城南归。安北中兵参军沈庆之认为历城兵少粮多，想用箱式战车装载，以精锐部队在外侧护卫，夹道护送江夏王刘义恭、武陵王刘骏两位王爷及他们的妃子和女儿直奔历城；同时分出一部分兵力配属护军萧思话，让他留守彭城。太尉长史何勖想裹挟全部人马财物逃奔郁洲，从海路返回京师。刘义恭离开的决心已定，只是对这两个方案争论了一整天也没有结果。安北长史、沛郡太守张畅说：“如果历城、郁洲确有可以到达的道理，下官怎敢不高声赞成！如今城里缺粮，百姓都有逃走的心思，只是因为城门紧闭，关防严密，想离开也无从离开罢了。一旦他们动身，就会各自逃散，想让他们到达该去的地方，又怎么可能办到！现在军粮虽然不多，但短时间内还不至于吃完；哪有舍弃万全之策而走上危亡之路的道理！如果这个弃城之计一定要实行，下官请求用自己脖子上的鲜血玷污大王的马蹄。”武陵王刘骏对刘义恭说：“阿父既然身为统帅，去留不是我敢干预的；道民愧为一城之主，如果抛弃城池奔逃，实在没有脸面再侍奉朝廷，必定与这座城池共存亡，张长史的话不可有异议。”刘义恭这才打消了离开的念头。","content_jianti_auto":"魏兵在萧城，去彭城十余里。彭城兵虽多而食少，太尉江夏王义恭欲弃彭城南归。安北中兵参军沈庆之以为历城兵少食多，欲为函箱车陈，以精兵为外翼，奉二王及妃女直趋历城；分兵配护军萧思话，使留守彭城。太尉长史何勗欲席卷奔郁洲，自海道还京师。义恭去意已判，惟二议弥日未决。安北长史沛郡太守张畅曰：「若历城、郁洲有可至之理，下官敢不高赞！今城中乏食，百姓咸有走志，但以关扃严固，欲去莫从耳。一旦动足，则各自逃散，欲至所在，何由可得！今军食虽寡，朝夕犹未窘罄；岂有舍万安之术而就危亡之道！若此计必行，下官请以颈血汚公马蹄。武陵王骏谓义恭曰：「阿父既为总统，去留非所敢干，道民忝为城主，而委镇奔逃，实无颜复奉朝廷，必与此城共其存没，张长史言不可异也。」义恭乃止。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"繇此观之，拓拔氏岂果有不可当之势哉？勇奋于生死之交，谋决...","context_before":"...进，我斩卿，我不进，卿斩我。”流血凝肘而不退，兵是以胜。","source_end_index":106,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a1538a12-de44-4864-9392-37604e507ef4","source_start_index":51,"source_text":"武陵王骏之守彭城而固也，张畅谓江夏王义恭曰：“若欲弃城，下官请以颈血污公马蹄。”骏听之，誓与城存亡，城是以全。"}],"title":"一八 观王玄谟论兵知其必败"}],"id":11709,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二十五 (宋紀七) / 太祖文皇帝中之下 / 二十七年 / 第 52 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"a88db58e-db0e-11ef-bfb7-a0d3651f611f","year_int":450},"tongjian_id":"a88db58e-db0e-11ef-bfb7-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"沛郡","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"揚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬州","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e579-db0e-11ef-aa29-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"六合縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"六合县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e57a-db0e-11ef-b85c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石梁河","place_name_jianti_auto":"石梁河","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e57b-db0e-11ef-bada-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江左","place_name_jianti_auto":"江左","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e57c-db0e-11ef-a4f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石梁郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"石梁郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e57d-db0e-11ef-a9f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e57e-db0e-11ef-ae48-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e57f-db0e-11ef-83bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石梁縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"石梁县","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e580-db0e-11ef-ba32-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"今揚州六合縣石梁河，江左置石梁郡，隋唐之間置石梁縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"今扬州六合县石梁河，江左置石梁郡，隋唐之间置石梁县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e578-db0e-11ef-bf8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"章帝","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e582-db0e-11ef-90c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"樂平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐平县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e583-db0e-11ef-8a39-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e584-db0e-11ef-9d61-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清","place_name_jianti_auto":"清","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e585-db0e-11ef-9017-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"东郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e586-db0e-11ef-9b8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e587-db0e-11ef-ba97-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂平","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐平","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e588-db0e-11ef-814d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江左","place_name_jianti_auto":"江左","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e589-db0e-11ef-9487-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐平县","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e58a-db0e-11ef-8c7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"樂平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"乐平县","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e58b-db0e-11ef-acbd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鍾離郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"钟离郡","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e58c-db0e-11ef-bea7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"樂平縣，前漢曰清，屬東郡，後漢章帝更名樂平；江左界樂平縣民流寓者，僑立樂平縣於鍾離郡界。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乐平县，前汉曰清，属东郡，后汉章帝更名乐平；江左界乐平县民流寓者，侨立乐平县于钟离郡界。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e581-db0e-11ef-b708-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"申孝叔","people_name_jianti_auto":"申孝叔","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e58e-db0e-11ef-8699-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"申孝叔報父之讎也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"申孝叔报父之雠也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e58d-db0e-11ef-9ee0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","resolved_place_entity_id":704,"start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"a9b7bda1-db0e-11ef-8b8c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"石梁见六合县。○公路城，在县东，袁术据淮南时所筑。又盱眙...","context_before":"乐平城[在县东南。本汉县，属东郡。江左侨置于钟离郡界。","source_end_index":51,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"57111867-c33d-555a-a14d-a849a9c7a8d3","source_start_index":27,"source_text":"宋泰始二年，薛安都从子索儿自石梁溃走乐平，即此。"},{"context_after":"梁承圣二年，秦州刺史严超达围齐泾，州侯瑱等俱出石梁，为超...","context_before":"石梁城[县北二十五里。江左所置戍守处也。","source_end_index":68,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2a5b83b3-d37d-5291-ab96-fd543da07503","source_start_index":20,"source_text":"宋泰始二年，薛安都举兵彭城，应晋安王子勋，遣其从子索儿引兵向广陵，为张永、萧道成所败，退保石梁。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/二、凤阳府（卷二十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"31張永、蕭道成等與薛索兒戰，大破之，索兒退保石梁；食盡而潰，走向樂平，爲申令孫子孝叔所斬。薛安都子道智走向合肥，詣裴季之降。傅靈越走至淮西，武衞將軍沛郡王廣之生獲之，送詣劉勔。勔詰其叛逆，靈越曰：「九州唱義，豈獨在我！薛公不能專任智勇，委付子姪，此其所以敗也。人生歸於一死，實無面求活。」勔送詣建康。上欲赦之，靈越辭終不改，乃殺之。","content_fanyi":"张永、萧道成等人与薛索儿交战，大破薛索儿军，薛索儿退守石梁；军粮耗尽后部众溃散，薛索儿逃往乐平，被申令孙的儿子申孝叔斩杀。薛安都的儿子薛道智逃往合肥，到裴季之处投降。傅灵越逃到淮西，被武卫将军沛郡人王广之活捉，送到刘勔那里。刘勔责问他反叛之罪，傅灵越说：“九州各地都有人倡导义举，哪里只是我一个人！薛公不能信任重用智勇之士，只把事情交给子侄，这就是他失败的原因。人生终归一死，我实在没有脸面苟且求生。”刘勔将他押送建康。明帝想赦免他，傅灵越始终不肯改口，于是将他处死。","content_jianti_auto":"31张永、萧道成等与薛索儿战，大破之，索儿退保石梁；食尽而溃，走向乐平，为申令孙子孝叔所斩。薛安都子道智走向合肥，诣裴季之降。傅灵越走至淮西，武衞将军沛郡王广之生获之，送诣刘勔。勔诘其叛逆，灵越曰：「九州唱义，岂独在我！薛公不能专任智勇，委付子姪，此其所以败也。人生归于一死，实无面求活。」勔送诣建康。上欲赦之，灵越辞终不改，乃杀之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12266,"number":31,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十一 (宋紀十三) / 太宗明皇帝上之下 / 泰始二年 / 第 58 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"a9b6e577-db0e-11ef-8275-a0d3651f611f","year_int":466},"tongjian_id":"a9b6e577-db0e-11ef-8275-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"沛郡","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"晉穆帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋穆帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7762-db0e-11ef-9e75-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"李延寿","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7763-db0e-11ef-9741-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒼梧","place_name_jianti_auto":"苍梧","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7764-db0e-11ef-9121-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉康郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋康郡","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7765-db0e-11ef-b12d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"端州","place_name_jianti_auto":"端州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7766-db0e-11ef-9207-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蠻","place_name_jianti_auto":"蛮","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7767-db0e-11ef-96f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜑","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜑","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7768-db0e-11ef-92c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"獽","place_name_jianti_auto":"獽","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7769-db0e-11ef-af13-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"俚","place_name_jianti_auto":"俚","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"a9ee776a-db0e-11ef-9226-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"獠","place_name_jianti_auto":"獠","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"a9ee776b-db0e-11ef-98b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"㐌","place_name_jianti_auto":"㐌","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"a9ee776c-db0e-11ef-91a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉穆帝永和七年，分蒼梧立晉康郡，今端州卽其地。李延壽曰：記云：南方曰蠻，有不火食者矣。然其種類非一，與華人錯居；其流曰蜑，曰獽，曰俚，曰獠，曰㐌，居無君長，隨山洞而居。俚，音里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋穆帝永和七年，分苍梧立晋康郡，今端州即其地。李延寿曰：记云：南方曰蛮，有不火食者矣。然其种类非一，与华人错居；其流曰蜑，曰獽，曰俚，曰獠，曰㐌，居无君长，随山洞而居。俚，音里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7761-db0e-11ef-8929-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":17,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"羊玄保見一百二十三卷文帝元嘉十七年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a82a2143-db0e-11ef-a7f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"羊玄保","people_name_jianti_auto":"羊玄保","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7771-db0e-11ef-9305-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7772-db0e-11ef-bba0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"羊玄保見一百二十三卷文帝元嘉十七年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"羊玄保见一百二十三卷文帝元嘉十七年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7770-db0e-11ef-8899-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡","resolved_place_entity_id":704,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7777-db0e-11ef-931d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、广州府（卷一百一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"梁太清末，广州刺史元景仲附侯景，西江督护陈霸先等讨之，声...","context_before":"...道环回，朔望升拜，名曰朝台。后为西候津亭，因名曰朝亭也。","source_end_index":101,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e50bfe84-0db9-55b1-8af4-624003552ecf","source_start_index":70,"source_text":"宋泰始四年，叛将刘思道还攻广州，刺史羊希遣兵御之于朝亭，败绩。"}],"path":"广东方舆纪要/一、广州府（卷一百一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"9廣州刺史羊希使晉康太守沛郡劉思道伐俚。思道違節度失利，希遣收之；思道帥所領攻州，希兵敗而死。龍驤將軍陳伯紹將兵伐俚，還擊思道，擒斬之。希，玄保之兄子也。","content_fanyi":"刘宋广州刺史羊希派晋康太守、沛郡人刘思道讨伐俚人部落。刘思道违背调度命令而失利，羊希派人收捕他；刘思道率领所部攻打州城，羊希兵败而死。龙骧将军陈伯绍率兵征伐俚人部落，得到消息后回军攻击刘思道，将他擒获斩首。羊希是羊玄保的侄子。","content_jianti_auto":"9广州刺史羊希使晋康太守沛郡刘思道伐俚。思道违节度失利，希遣收之；思道帅所领攻州，希兵败而死。龙骧将军陈伯绍将兵伐俚，还击思道，擒斩之。希，玄保之兄子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12364,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百三十二 (宋紀十四) / 太宗明皇帝中 / 四年 / 第 11 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a9ee7760-db0e-11ef-8e16-a0d3651f611f","year_int":468},"tongjian_id":"a9ee7760-db0e-11ef-8e16-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":2,"total_paragraphs":11},"place_name":"沛郡"},"message":"success","success":true}